{"license":"CC0-1.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Onwenselijk gedrag in de sport"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Arvodi-regeling"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:61028"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"J. van Kalmthout"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Mulier Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"R van den Dool"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Mulier Instituut"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Onderzoek naar onwenselijk gedrag in de sport bij sportverenigingen (2008, 2011, 2013) en bij de Nederlandse bevolking (2010, 2011).<\/p><p>De onderzoeken zijn uitgevoerd in het kader van het monitoren van onwenselijk gedrag in de sport. De eerste meting bij sportverenigingen is uitgevoerd in het kader van het onderzoek naar misstanden in de sport in samenwerking met het SCP in opdracht van VWS. De metingen onder de bevolking en verenigingen in 2010 en 2011 zijn uitgevoerd in het kader van het monitoren van het programma ‘Samen voor Sportiviteit en Respect’ dat onder regie en coördinatie stond van de Koninklijke Nederlandse Hockey Bond. Dat programma is overgegaan in het programma ‘Samen naar een Veiliger Sportklimaat’. Het Mulier Instituut voert hier de monitoring voor uit in opdracht van het Ministerie van VWS.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"geweld"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"sportiviteit"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"veilig sportklimaat"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"samen voor sportiviteit en respect"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"ongewenst gedrag"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"sport"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"sportverenigingen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Programma Samen voor Sportiviteit en Respect"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Programma Samen naar een Veiliger Sportklimaat"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2014-12-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal en Cultureel Planbureau (SCP)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName",